- [x] [Web-Based Music Import](prd/web-import.md) — drag-and-drop zip upload page; Bandcamp + Amazon formats; auto-rescan
  - `api/app/routers/import_music.py` — POST /import/upload; Bandcamp + Amazon format detection + extraction
  - `web/src/pages/ImportPage.jsx` — drop zone, per-file status rows, upload progress bar, auto-rescan on success
  - "Import Music" link added to user menu (Layout.jsx)
  - nginx updated: `client_max_body_size 600M` + `proxy_read_timeout 120s` in `/etc/nginx/default.d/calliope.conf`
  - Amazon extractor copies cover art (Folder.jpg / any image at album level) in addition to audio files
  - Upload progress via axios `onUploadProgress` — button shows "Uploading… 42%" + accent progress bar
- [x] [Dynamic Color Theme](prd/dynamic-theme.md) — accent color extracted from album art via Vibrant.js
  - `web/src/hooks/useAlbumAccent.js` — Vibrant palette extraction + JS-driven sRGB animation (requestAnimationFrame)
  - Three dynamic tiers: `--accent` (main, page titles + links), `--accent-hover` (lighter, hover states), `--accent2` (darker, nav logo)
  - All derived from Vibrant hue at baseL±0.22; guaranteed visible separation regardless of palette content
  - CSS `@property` + transition approach was scrapped — Chromium uses OKLab for `@property` interpolation which flashes washed-out on big hue shifts
  - Art elements (`.np-art`, `.player-art-thumb`) got `background: var(--surface2)` — prevents white flash on image load
